BE-300 2.6.8.1: ttyS0 on the VRC4173 dock UART.

The linux4be 2.6 serial_be300.c was an unfinished 2.4-style driver, so
this is a 2.6.8 rewrite carrying the 2.4.18 behaviour (patches 0009 and
0015): ttyS0 = major 4 minor 64, polled RX at 100 Hz, synchronous TX,
115200 8N1 with DTR/RTS for the emulator's --serial1-bridge, an optional
console (console=ttyS0), and no RBR reads or LCR writes while the
Stowaway keyboard owns the port.

